{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04971","headline":"陇右途中遭非语 · 员半千","name":"陇右途中遭非语","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赵有两毛遂，鲁闻二曾参。\n慈母犹且惑，况在行路心。\n冠冕无丑士，贿赂成知己。\n名利我所无，清浊谁见理。\n敝服空逢春，缓带不着身。\n出游非怀璧，何忧乎忌人。\n正须自保爱，振衣出世尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"员半千","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04971.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04971","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}